      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Camcorder CRT can aim at its own screen: its Last Frame is the Output's Frame Out, and Feedback mixes that back in, zoomed and turned, the way a camcorder pointed at its own monitor makes a corridor of screens. Drag and scroll in its viewfinder to aim it, or turn Zoom, Rotate and Feedback."
